# DocuBot

Embeddable customer service chatbot. Operators upload a manual and
get a chat widget that answers questions from that manual only.

## Requirements

- Docker
- Python 3.14

## Setup

    python -m venv .venv
    source .venv/bin/activate
    pip install -r requirements.txt
    cp .env.example .env

Then edit `.env` and add your OpenAI API key.

## Running

    docker compose up -d
    alembic upgrade head
    uvicorn app.main:app --reload

API docs: http://localhost:8000/docs

## Current status

Working:
- Client registration with API key
- Authenticated PDF upload with per-client isolation
- Manual retrieval

Not built yet:
- Chunking, embeddings, retrieval
- Chat endpoint